1
00:00:00,683 --> 00:00:02,333
But Cyrie...

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:06,116
What if you wait and wait, but that hero never arrives...

3
00:00:08,633 --> 00:00:09,183
That won't happen.

4
00:00:10,599 --> 00:00:11,316
Because I know that...

5
00:00:12,766 --> 00:00:13,916
No matter how long it takes...

6
00:00:14,766 --> 00:00:16,016
{M#He}{F#She}'ll definitely return to this place.

7
00:00:17,633 --> 00:00:19,350
We can't let {M#him}{F#her} down.

8
00:00:37,216 --> 00:00:39,683
Sky shall rain rays of dawn for you...

9
00:00:40,433 --> 00:00:43,216
May Romance be with you on your journey...

10
00:00:43,766 --> 00:00:46,116
And Reason grant you enlightenment...

11
00:00:46,766 --> 00:00:49,016
Let Strife bestow you with inspiration...

12
00:00:49,466 --> 00:00:51,733
Trickery ensure your success...

13
00:00:52,233 --> 00:00:55,016
Allow Death to protect your soul...

14
00:00:55,916 --> 00:00:59,866
And at last, let Passage point the way forward...

15
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:02,233
While Time...

16
00:01:03,250 --> 00:01:04,933
...Will remember Trailblaze's journey.

